  "name": "Team Skill Details",
  "description": "Retrieves a skills summary for employees who report directly to a manager and supports questions about their skills.\nIn workflow mode, set `workflowMode` to `true` and provide the manager’s `personId`; the workflow returns their direct reports’ skills summary as JSON. In Agentic app mode, it uses the logged-in user as the manager, with no `personId` required, and displays employee names, total, achieved, role, core, and top skills in tables with access to employee skill details.",
